## Purpose
N7NN holds actual Colab investigations/questions; no .colab tail. This book declares
workflow space0 only:0700–0799, door0700.band.colabs. Members/pass allocation obeys
existing page/band rules and declared sub-bands; a free integer is not permission.
One investigation may target several exact files/sections and have multiple05.NN
passes. The investigation's identity is separate from the subjects it examines.

## Shape
01 purpose/question/targets/scope/known limits.05.NN each pass's instructions/release/
work/review pointers.06 reasoning/findings/Director replies/dispositions.03/08 point
to actual sources and captured returns. Submission bytes remain in0100 return
members. Typed targets bind exact book/page/file/section and source commit/hash.
No automatic review approval, execution release or role from location alone.

